baidunetdisk-rs (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Initial release of the pure-Rust Baidu Netdisk desktop client:
    - multi-connection segmented downloads with resume and queueing
    - chunked uploads, share creation/transfer and file management
    - built-in previewer for text, Markdown, images and PDF (hayro)
    - wgpu renderer with per-image GPU textures for large previews

